{"id":"7308daa58e0345ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md","title":"Well-Founded Relation","display":"df-wellfounded — Well-Founded Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-wellfounded","aliases":["58-df-wellfounded"],"display":"df-wellfounded — Well-Founded Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-wellfounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-wellfounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wellfounded — Well-Founded Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A\\in V\">\\(R,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(R\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span> (binary relation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> (well-founded-relation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wellfounded} \\vdash \\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land \\forall S\\subseteq A\\;\\left(S\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;(\\langle x,m\\rangle\\notin R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wellfounded} \\vdash \\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land \\forall S\\subseteq A\\;\\left(S\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;(\\langle x,m\\rangle\\notin R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A well-founded relation has no infinite descending chain; the converse uses an appropriate dependent-choice principle.</li>\n<li>Every well-founded relation admits a rank function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq A\\times A$ (binary relation; see [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wellfounded} \\vdash \\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land \\forall S\\subseteq A\\;\\left(S\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;(\\langle x,m\\rangle\\notin R)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":880,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6ec5105268243bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (well-founded-relation predicate; see [[58-df-wellfounded]])"},{"id":"37a3e43a3599a849","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fdc9f29c49f2cdf0","anchor":"ref-1","loca